      "id": "claim_4bad0167364c41719813cd42504f2c63",
      "statement": "The vision client is constructed from the enrichment.vlm configuration block falling back to the main llm block, and only when enrichment is active, so a different provider may describe images than judges text and no enrichment credential is required for a plain run.",
