      "id": "claim_b7a646adc517487c8d00441ac5acc8a9",
      "statement": "Image enrichment applies only to PDFs: Word and PowerPoint documents emit Block(kind=\"image\") but no ImageRef and therefore no placeholder token, so the substitution stage finds nothing to replace and is a no-op for them.",
