      "id": "claim_69a51d85ef2e4cb4924dbe2cd7187cca",
      "statement": "Enrichment now also runs inside `cqg parse`, which writes the enriched markdown as the entry's `<doc_id>.md` and the cropped images under `<parsed_dir>/images/<doc_id>/`, because enrich_document needs the source PDF that scoring must no longer open and because parsed_input/ is defined as the document as it will be ingested into RAG.",
