    {
      "id": "claim_cdcf7752ab2d460ea4ae24e9e9677e3a",
      "statement": "`--enrich` remains active on `cqg run` over a raw folder, but on a parsed_input/ it emits a RuntimeWarning stating \"--enrich est sans objet sur un parsed_input/ : l'enrichissement a lieu dans `cqg parse`. Option ignoree.\" and is ignored; the flag is cleared before the VLM client would be constructed, so no enrichment API key is demanded to do nothing.",
