    {
      "id": "claim_49ac07f7ec60495f83aecf5635fe621d",
      "statement": "The sidecar written by `cqg parse` keeps the pre-enrichment blocks and image geometry — enrichment rewrites the markdown only — while the provenance records `enriched: true`, so the ImageRef bounding boxes stay usable and a reader can tell which kind of entry they are looking at.",
