    {
      "id": "claim_96bbd70ab5ae426c9c491592198fce5a",
      "statement": "Inside `cqg parse` the enrichment call carries its own try/except nested in the per-document one: a rate limit, timeout or unreadable image is recorded in the result's errors and the entry is written un-enriched, rather than a perfectly parsed document disappearing from parsed_input/ while the command reports success.",
